@startuml i2-packages
' I2 (implementation, component): Go packages and their imports. Owner: team.
' From: go list -f '{{.ImportPath}}: {{join .Imports " "}}' ./...
' Edges to metrics, logging, config and gen/sparecycles/v1 are left out (see the legend).
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam legendFontSize 10
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 15
skinparam ranksep 35

package "cmd" {
  [keygen] as CmdKey
  [coordinator] as CmdCoord
  [volunteer] as CmdVol
  [client] as CmdClient
  [loadgen] as CmdLoad
}

package "internal" {
  [coordinator] as Coord
  [volunteer] as Vol

  rectangle "Coordinator parts" as Parts {
    [election] as Election
    [replication] as Replication
    [lease] as Lease
    [verify] as Verify
    [scheduler] as Scheduler
    [tasktable] as Table
    [membership] as Membership
    [security] as Security
    [workload] as Workload
  }

  [peerconn] as PeerConn
  [leaderclient] as LeaderClient
}

package "shared (import edges not drawn)" as Shared {
  [metrics] as Metrics
  [logging] as Logging
  [config] as Config
  [gen/sparecycles/v1] as Gen
}

CmdCoord --> Coord
CmdCoord --> Parts
CmdCoord --> PeerConn
Coord --> Parts

CmdVol --> Vol
CmdVol --> LeaderClient
CmdVol --> Membership
CmdVol --> Security
CmdVol --> Workload

CmdClient --> LeaderClient
CmdLoad --> LeaderClient
CmdKey --> Security

Vol --> LeaderClient
Vol --> Security
Vol --> Workload

Election --> PeerConn
Replication --> PeerConn
Replication --> Table
Lease --> Table
Lease --> Scheduler
Scheduler --> Table
Verify --> Table

Table -[hidden]down- Metrics
Metrics -[hidden]right- Logging
Logging -[hidden]right- Config
Config -[hidden]right- Gen

legend bottom
  An arrow to "Coordinator parts" means an import of every package in it.
  gen/sparecycles/v1 is imported by cmd/client, cmd/loadgen, cmd/volunteer, and by
  internal/coordinator, volunteer, election, replication and membership.
  metrics: cmd/coordinator, coordinator, election, replication, membership, scheduler.
  logging: cmd/coordinator, cmd/volunteer. config: every binary except keygen.
endlegend
@enduml
